    simpa using GlobalTheory.HL.WitIndep.frame_mem S S.f' S.es' (Or.inr ⟨rfl, rfl⟩) d.2.1 hin' 1 b
  refine ⟨hin, hin', hw, hw', hA, hA', fun b => ?_, hg⟩
